  const MINIMAL_CONFIG = {
    name: "obsidian",
    mcpServerConfig: {
      command: "npx",
      args: ["@bitbonsai/mcpvault", "/x"],
    },
  };
  ```

  The exact field values are not under test; only the shape needs to
  satisfy the type. If the prerequisite parser/type refactor has
  already collapsed `BrainAideConfig` to two fields, this fixture
  must match that collapse. If the parser still carries the old
  fields at the time this test is rewritten, escalate — the
  prerequisites have not landed.

- [x] 2c. Update the `makeOkState` helper and every inline state
