Read: `coding-playbook/workflow/testing`, `coding-playbook/foundations/conventions`

- [x] 3a. Run `npx tsc --noEmit` from the project root. Expect zero
  errors in `src/tools/brain/`. If the prerequisite type-shrink in
  `src/types/index.ts` and the prerequisite detector refactor in
