- [x] 3b. Run `npm test -- tools/brain` (or
  `npx vitest run src/tools/brain/`). Expect every test to pass.

- [x] 3c. Run the full project test suite once
  (`npm test` or `npx vitest run`) to confirm no other consumer
  regresses. The brain tool's response shape has not changed
  (`{ status, instructions }` was already the contract); the only
  behavioral changes are the removal of one branch and the retarget
  of the defensive fallback. Consumers that branch on
